  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ちくせき　された　パワーで　あいてを\nこうげきする。じぶんの　のうりょくが\nあがって　いるほど　いりょくが　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "축적된 파워로 상대를\n공격한다. 자신의 능력이\n올라가 있는 만큼 위력이 오른다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用蓄積的力量攻擊對手。\n自己的能力提高越多，\n招式的威力越大。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur attaque l’ennemi avec une force accumulée.\nPlus les stats du lanceur sont augmentées,\nplus le coup est efficace.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Angriff mit angesparter Energie. Je stärker die\nStatuswerte des Anwenders erhöht wurden, desto mehr\nSchaden richtet diese Attacke an.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Acumula poder para golpear. Cuanto más suban las\ncaracterísticas del usuario, mayor será el daño.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Attacca il bersaglio con l’energia accumulata.\nPiù sono state aumentate le statistiche, maggiore\nè il danno inflitto.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user attacks the target with stored power.\nThe more the user’s stats are raised, the greater\nthe move’s power.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "蓄積された　パワーで　相手を\n攻撃する。自分の　能力が\nあがっているほど　威力が　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用蓄积起来的力量攻击对手。\n自己的能力提高得越多，威力就越大。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Acumula poder para golpear. Cuanto más suban las\ncaracterísticas del usuario, mayor será el daño.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
